333
00:22:58,500 --> 00:23:02,009
For new execution, follow the tested runbook in
order.

334
00:23:02,289 --> 00:23:07,694
Acquire pinned source and assets, validate the
native flows, build the two custom

335
00:23:07,694 --> 00:23:10,162
extensions, and run numerical checks.

336
00:23:10,443 --> 00:23:12,796
Then train, evaluate or predict.

337
00:23:13,077 --> 00:23:19,651
The tested route used an arm sixty-four Python
environment, G B ten, and a recorded C

338
00:23:19,651 --> 00:23:22,126
U D A compiler and driver stack.

339
00:23:22,407 --> 00:23:27,178
It is not a universal Windows, C P U model, or N
P U setup.

340
00:23:27,459 --> 00:23:33,192
Prediction accepts assembled native flow
records, not the supplied packet C S Vs.

341
00:23:33,473 --> 00:23:38,149
Use new output directories and retain
class-mapping provenance with every moved

342
00:23:38,149 --> 00:23:38,800
checkpoint.

343
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:44,981
The existing audited release includes the
complete package zip, briefing P D F, slide

344
00:23:44,981 --> 00:23:51,090
P D F, editable PowerPoint, a checksum list, a
release inventory, and a verification

345
00:23:51,090 --> 00:23:51,672
receipt.

346
00:23:51,953 --> 00:23:57,580
The inventory names files; hashes identify their
bytes; the receipt records actual

347
00:23:57,580 --> 00:23:58,678
delivery checks.

348
00:23:58,959 --> 00:24:03,628
The package does not contain raw research data
or inherited model weights.

349
00:24:03,909 --> 00:24:08,171
The file walkthrough explains every tracked item
and release download.

350
00:24:08,452 --> 00:24:13,734
This narrated video is a later deliverable with
its own media checks, transcript and

351
00:24:13,734 --> 00:24:14,299
captions.

352
00:24:14,580 --> 00:24:18,200
A successful download is not a new accuracy
experiment.

353
00:24:18,200 --> 00:24:23,223
A colleague with an ordinary laptop wants to
check how the reported scores were

354
00:24:23,223 --> 00:24:23,922
