400
00:27:30,923 --> 00:27:33,500
This is practice, not a certification.

401
00:27:33,500 --> 00:29:03,500
[Practice pause: 90 seconds] Inputs and
lifecycle Measured results versus the paper
Demo, evidence and limitations

402
00:29:03,500 --> 00:29:09,214
A concise explanation could be: We ran the
original multimodal classifier on

403
00:29:09,214 --> 00:29:11,169
compatible released flows.

404
00:29:11,462 --> 00:29:15,732
Training changed its weights; inference used a
